# Store listing IDs of the Spate extension. Empty until published.
#
# Once set, every installer (macOS .pkg / install-macos.sh, Windows NSIS /
# spate-setup.exe, Debian .deb / install-linux.sh) registers the extension
# with each Chromium-family browser found on the machine, so the browser
# installs it from the store by itself: silently on Linux, after a one-click
# "Enable extension" prompt on Windows and macOS. See browser/STORE.md.
#
# Chrome Web Store ID (also used by Brave, Chromium and Vivaldi):
CHROME_WEBSTORE_ID=
# Microsoft Edge Add-ons ID (Edge installs from its own store):
EDGE_ADDONS_ID=
